Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:49.29,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"KALAU KAU TAK MAU, AKU KABUR SAJA"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:09.78,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"TAMAN MANUSIA"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu kota kerajaan lebih jauh\Ndari yang kukira.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.81,0:00:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana keadaan sang Putri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kelelahan. Bahkan susah berdiri\Ndengan kekuatannya sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, mengejutkan juga dia masih hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memanggil Dewa Penjaga ke dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasukan perbatasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalahkan mereka sekaligus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putar balik penuh! Mundur sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi kalau kita kabur...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau pikir seberapa besar penderitaan kita\Ndemi Istana selama ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tak wajib berjuang demi mereka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.41,0:00:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita lari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mundur!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei! Bagaimana dengan kami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan pergi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau yakin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:01:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan merasa bersalah kalau cuma diam\Nmenyaksikan warga Kerajaan Holfort mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak berhak,\Nkalau tahu banyak nyawa akan hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.62,0:01:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, semua anak lelaki\Ningin alami ini sekali seumur hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.87,0:01:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi panglima tertinggi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Trapped in a Dating Sim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}The World of Otome Games\Nis Tough for Mobs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Trapped in a Dating Sim 2: The World\Nof Otome Games is Tough for Mobs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Panglima tertinggi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejujurnya, kau belum cukup dipercaya\Natau berprestasi untuk dipertimbangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menugaskanmu akan membuat\Nkewarasanku dipertanyakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:02:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau tak mau, aku kabur saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.66,0:03:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada orang yang lebih cocok dariku?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang ini, kalian bahkan tak bisa\Nmendekati pasukan Kerajaan Fanoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian cuma akan tersingkir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.55,0:03:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk keluar dari kesulitan ini,\Nkapal kerajaan diperlukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kau bisa tahu\Nsoal kapal kerajaan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu pendorong berdirinya Kerajaan\Nsekaligus kartu as Kerajaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapal itu tak bisa diaktifkan dengan mudah.\NItu barang hilang!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu diperlukan.\NTolong pinjamkan itu padaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu takkan bergerak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang Mulia dan aku tak bisa\Nmembuatnya berfungsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita akan pakai Pangeran Julius dan Marie.\NKumpulkan juga empat lainnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi dia... Dia menunggu eksekusi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, minta mereka kemudikan kapal\Nsebelum dia terima hukumannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak ada cara untuk menang\Ntanpa menempatkan Livia di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:04:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon, bisakah kau menang?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kumenangkan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi untuk itu, aku butuh kapal kerajaan\Ndan posisi panglima tertinggi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Marquess Frampton\Ntakkan mungkin bisa tetap diam saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pimpin faksi terbesar di Istana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita punya sedikit sekutu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begitu, aku cukup yakin\Ntetap perlu melakukannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah. Tapi kau harus kembali\Ndengan selamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mengerti?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, tentu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Sejujurnya, ini mungkin\Nkesalahan kami sendiri,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku berharap\Npara kesatria lain setia sepertimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Salah kalian sendiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu apa dengan itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami paksakan beban pada banyak pria,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.05,0:04:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}khususnya mereka di perbatasan,\Nyang menyebabkan hal ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.97,0:04:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kujelaskan semuanya padamu, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu sekutu kami sedikit dan tak bisa\Nmengandalkan bantuan orang lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, aku punya kekuatan persahabatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, mustahil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami bersembunyi karena takut perang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak bangsawan dan kesatria\Nkabur berbondong-bondong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa yang mau perjuangkan kerajaan begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siswa biasa tak punya kesempatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuharap keluargaku\Nakan segera datang jemput aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar kalian! Ke mana harga diri\Ndan kehormatan kalian sebagai bangsawan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon, menyerahlah.\NMereka tangkap kau atas tuduhan palsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak ada alasan\Nuntuk lakukan apa pun demi mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau Kerajaan Holfort kalah,\Ntinggal ikuti Kerajaan Fanoss saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.14,0:05:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar kedudukan pria lebih tinggi\Ndari wanita di Kerajaan Fanoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?! Akan kusumpah setia\Nke Kerajaan Fanoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian lihat ini, tidak?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:06:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kontrak penjualan kapal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian ambil kapal terbang dariku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bilang kalian sudah lupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian tahu kapal kalian cuma bisa\Ndirawat di pabrik keluargaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian akan susah tanpa kapal, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian akan lepaskan kapal\Nyang akhirnya kalian dapat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian akan kesulitan besar\Ncari istri nantinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, coba pikir.\NAku akan lawan Kerajaan Fanoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian terima senjata dariku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian pikir bisa membelot\Nke Kerajaan Fanoss begitu saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau aku kalah, mereka pasti\Nakan anggap kalian berpihak padaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Fanoss benci Kerajaan Holfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian bisa saja dijual jadi budak\Natau dibantai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi jangan khawatir.\NAku pasti akan menang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Percayalah padaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Argh! Sialan! Kau selalu main kotor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau kesatria jahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:07:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh? Itu pujian?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihatlah, Kerajaan Fanoss!\NInilah kekuatan persahabatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar iblis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.77,0:07:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seorang siswa jadi panglima tertinggi?\NIni belum pernah terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlepas itu, Tuan tetap inginkan\Nposisi panglima tertinggi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasukan yang diketahui bisa dikerahkan\Nberjumlah 20 kapal, termasuk Partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Besarnya pasukan dari Kerajaan\Ntak diketahui.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuil sudah kehilangan motivasi dan muka.\NMereka tak bisa diandalkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tak bisa dapatkan dukungan\Ndari bangsawan perbatasan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka sudah sibuk\Ndengan invasi dari negara lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.05,0:07:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlebih lagi, kesetiaan mereka\Nke Kerajaan lemah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak yang sudah menyerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bangsawan patuh ke Kerajaan cuma karena\Nmereka ditundukkan kekuatan militer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau minta bantuan ayahku,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi setelah mempermalukan keluargaku,\Nmungkin hak warisku juga sudah dicabut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri duke sedang membungkuk\Nbersama rakyat jelata!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memalukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, sampai separah itu\Nkejatuhan Keluarga Redgrave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kucari tahu apa yang bisa\Nkulakukan untuk membantu Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu keputusanmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, aku akan percaya pada Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.07,0:08:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ange selalu menghadap ke depan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sementara aku selalu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang bisa kulakukan...\NApa yang bisa kulakukan sendiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon, bawa aku bersamamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah terlalu lama kau meremehkanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat biarkan kami naik kapal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Fanoss akan tiba sebentar lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biarkan aku naik juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak mau mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai dengan anak-anak! Jalan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Aku khawatir soal kalian,\Njadi aku ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:08:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau minta tolong pada Ayah juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka jebloskan kau ke penjara!\NKau kabur?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja tidak. Aku dibebaskan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dijebak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga punya banyak bukti.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Para bangsawan yang coba menarik hatiku
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bicara banyak dalam negosiasi mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu apa?\NLeon, jelaskan yang benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, itu cuma detail kecil...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.41,0:09:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bisa saja dihukum mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.11,0:09:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei! Apa yang kau lakukan\Nke Miall-ku?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampah ini jual anakku ke beberapa bajingan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia takkan lolos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.34,0:09:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Me-Menjual dia? Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Balcus! Apa yang kau lakukan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Segera masukkan kami ke kapal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kami ambil kembali\Nharta dari ibu kota juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.79,0:09:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau siap untuk apa yang terjadi selanjutnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:09:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tunggu! Dengar dulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:09:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini yang pantas kau dapat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak ada yang boleh sakiti orang\Nyang kusayangi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rutart, saatnya pertarungan pertamamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau putra sulung Zola.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sudah jalani hidup\Ntanpa kekurangan dan kesulitan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi itu berakhir hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau akan lindungi hal-hal yang kau sayangi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Takkan pernah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan beri aku perintah! Dasar bangsawan\Nnegara terbelakang yang biadab!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.43,0:10:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar! Kau tak bisa\Nkasih kami perintah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa yang izinkan kau\Njalani hidupmu sejauh ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serahkan Rutart padaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia akan diberangkatkan\Nsebagai putra sulung Keluarga Bartfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:10:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ja-Jangan mentang-mentang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rutart anakku dengan pria yang kucintai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Darah kotormu tak mengalir di dalam dirinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.49,0:11:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ti-Tidak, bukan itu maksudku!\NCuma bercanda! Lelucon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah yang selalu kupikirkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sungguh melegakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini akhir bagi kita, Zola.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu! Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.99,0:11:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pernikahan kita bubar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Tidak...\N- Kuminta kau pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon! Tempatkan kami di kapal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak mau mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luxion, di mana musuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan kecepatan saat ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mereka akan sampai di ibu kota kerajaan\Nsekitar 30 jam lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Viscount Bartfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menteri Bernard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah lama tak jumpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, sekali lagi terima kasih\Nsudah menjaga Clarice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah dengar semuanya dari Ratu Mylene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal tentara kerajaan,\Nyang bisa kami kumpulkan tak bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:12:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami cuma punya sekitar 50 kapal\Nyang bisa berfungsi dengan baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, itu lebih dari yang kuharapkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.09,0:12:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari pihakku, termasuk Partner,\Naku bisa sediakan 24 kapal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka makin dekat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Viscount, apa kau benar-benar bisa menang?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa menang.\NAku takkan terlibat kalau tak bisa menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi cuma kalau aku bisa\Ngerakkan kapal kerajaan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan aktifkan kekuatan Livia...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.27,0:12:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm. Kau benar-benar luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.99,0:12:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kau lamar Clarice\Nsetelah perang ini selesai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau benar-benar suka bercanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matanya terlalu serius!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.51,0:12:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ki-Kita bisa pertimbangkan itu\Nsetelah kita menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.79,0:12:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, dan orang yang kau minta ada di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuil sedang kacau, jadi mereka\Nserahkan dia ke tangan Istana.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, akhirnya dia di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bisa bayangkan sikapmu\Nyang biasa dari sikap ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat dia mengaku bukan Saint,\Nsemuanya terbalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengikutnya meninggalkannya,\Ndan Kuil perlakukan dia dengan buruk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, serius?\NAku bisa tertawa soal itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sama sekali tak bisa tertawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa tuanku akan dihukum mati?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengaku sebagai Saint kejahatan yang serius.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hukuman resminya belum dijatuhkan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi walau kita menang perang,\Naku ragu dia akan diampuni.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bartfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Marie, jangan dengarkan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami di sini untukmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Itu betul!\N- Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Ya!\N- Tak apa-apa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.84,0:13:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.59,0:13:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam! Diam! Diam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.22,0:14:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang baik-baik saja soal ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.22,0:14:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian semua, orang-orang bodoh\Nyang gampang ditipu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa gunanya kalian?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah... Akhirnya\Ndia tunjukkan sikap aslinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluar dari sini, kalian semua!\NAku benci kalian semua!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Marie, harap tenang!\NYang Mulia memikirkanmu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam! Kau keluar juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, jangan pernah kembali!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kau sebut aku teman...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jelas bohong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebodoh apa kau ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku manfaatkan kau! Karena kupikir\Nmob sialan itu takkan sukai itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan pernah berteman denganmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.26,0:14:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sangat pandai\Npertahankan kedok itu selama ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.01,0:14:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang sekali semuanya berakhir hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan itu! Marie cuma lelah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam! Tutup mulutmu!\NKau cuma punya otak untuk ilmu pedang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau juga, Otak Otot!\NKau cuma bisa bicara! Kau tak berguna!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, kau, si narsis! Kau menjijikkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak tahu apa yang kau pikirkan!\NKau bikin aku takut!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.70,0:15:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau masalah terbesarnya,\Nmantan Putra Mahkota!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tak berguna kecuali punya\Ngelar pangeran, dan kau buang itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betapa bodohnya kalian, orang aneh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian kesampingkan pangkat,\Nkehormatan, dan kekayaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian pikir itu bikin wanita bahagia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu tak masuk akal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hal yang sama berlaku untukmu,\Ndasar bocah nakal menyebalkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selalu bersikap seolah kau segalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian semua harus bersikap\Nlebih baik ke aku! Kalian semua!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian cuma perlu lakukan\Npersis seperti kataku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benci semua orang\Nyang tak berguna dan lawan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benci kalian semua!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sungguh memalukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam! Enyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan pernah bahagia karena kau ada!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kembalikan... Kembalikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kebahagiaanku... Kembalikan itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kembalikan! Kembalikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, syukurlah.\NKami dengar mereka bebaskan kau.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Apa yang sedang terjadi di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu, cuma beberapa hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya dia cuma tidur.\NBebannya pasti terlalu berat baginya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku perlu bicara dengannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, bisa kalian beri kami privasi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini... yang terjadi\Nsetelah mimpiku di desa elf?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.57,0:17:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat bodoh. Aku bisa saja\Npulang ke rumah, tapi aku keras kepala...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar bodoh. Kalau kau mau\Nbuat dirimu lelah dengan menangis,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kau bisa saja jalan kaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.06,0:17:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ya. Kakakku\Nakhirnya datang menjemputku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau tak bisa lakukan itu\Nsejak awal, dasar kakak sampah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau selalu harus bergantung padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu betul...\NKakakku bermulut jelek, tapi dia baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kemudian...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau harus mati?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena aku harus pergi ke luar negeri...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.57,0:18:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bisa melihatnya pada akhirnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengeluh padaku\Nseperti yang selalu kau lakukan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamatkan aku\Nseperti yang selalu kau lakukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia selalu mengingatkanku pada adikku\Ndari kehidupan terakhirku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia bikin aku lari\Nberputar-putar untuknya juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Haruskah kau biarkan dia tidur begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau takkan tampar dia sampai bangun\Ndan taruh dia di kapal kerajaan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, kau pikir aku ini apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria plin-plan tak ada gunanya\Nyang tak bisa berkomitmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau terlalu keras pada tuanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, kau sudah bangun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, waktunya bicara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak. Aku takkan lakukan apa pun\Nsampai kakakku datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau punya kakak? Kalau begitu,\Ndia pasti sampah tak berguna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan ngomong begitu soal kakakku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan, aku takkan lupa kau lakukan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau menendang dan berteriak,\Nlalu lakukan kekerasan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau benar-benar sampah.\NBahkan adikku lebih baik darimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam! Adikmu pasti wanita gila\Nyang otaknya cuma berisi rambut!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.61,0:19:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, dia gila, egois, dan sangat busuk,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi dia tetap 100 kali lebih baik darimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:20:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakakku bermulut buruk, berkepribadian\Nlebih jahat, dan berwajah mafia,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi dia 100 kali lebih baik...\Ntidak, bahkan lebih dari itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ugh. Ini konyol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa aku harus bertengkar denganmu\Ndi saat begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.87,0:20:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau mulai ikut campur\Ndalam urusan dunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau coba ambil posisi tokoh utama?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini lagi?! Sudah kubilang,\Nkarena aku mau cari kebahagiaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebodoh apa sih kau?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau selesaikan gim otome itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.76,0:20:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tahu kau butuh kekuatan Livia\Nuntuk kalahkan bos akhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana aku tahu itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, kau tak selesaikan gim itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya kakak...\NKakakku yang selesaikan gim itu untukku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.43,0:20:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kemudian kakakku meninggal...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah dia meninggal, dan aku melupakannya,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku cuma lihat apa yang dia simpan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma lihat gim\Ndari urutan akhir dan sebagainya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kumpulkan harem terbalik\Ncuma dari informasi itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.73,0:21:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu agak gila.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau minta kakakmu selesaikan gim untukmu?\NBodoh sekali kakakmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam! Bagaimana denganmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmph. Adikku minta aku\Nselesaikan gim itu untuknya,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan aku selesaikan\Ntiap bagian dari semuanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.41,0:21:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia perintahkan aku selesaikan gim itu\Nsementara dia liburan ke luar negeri...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.79,0:21:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.69,0:21:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Fanoss mendekat.\NSiapa pengkhianatnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.89,0:23:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma yang siap yang akan bertahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.10,0:23:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang, bukan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.41,0:23:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, "Tutup Mulut Kotormu, Sampah".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.15,0:23:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kasar banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lakukan yang aku bilang!\NKalau kau tak mau, mulai lari.
